0 // Reconstructed from the geometry preserved in the conversation.
0 // 251 standard-part placements; one hub and two medium angular motors.
0 // +Y down; 20 LDU/stud; 0.4 mm/LDU.
0 // Required accessories: battery, two 0.3 mm cords, LPF2 extension lead.
0 // The machine has no gripper. Cords suspend and position the gondola.
0 // See README.md and docs/BUILD.md before using the model.
